      <h1 class="article-title">The 95 Theses</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Martin Luther &middot; 1517</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">95 propositions challenging the sale of indulgences, sparking the Protestant Reformation.</p>
      <hr class="faith-doc-rule" aria-hidden="true">
      
